<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Solchem half yr shr dips, no div.</title>
<headline>Solchem half yr shr dips, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Sept 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     3.48	  vs 3.75</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.45	  vs 1.57</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   2.21	  vs 2.41</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.78	  vs 0.84</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.23	  vs 0.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		  42.91	 vs 41.56</p>
<p>Full name: Solchem Investment Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said competition in the ink business continues to be intense. The devaluation in the rand had also had an adverse effect on margins.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
